          "text": "Midnight departure from Islamabad. Breakfast at Muzaffarabad as the light comes up, then the Neelum valley road all day — tea at Keran, lunch past Sharda. Kel by mid-afternoon, the chairlift across the river, and the last stretch up on foot. Night in a hut at Arang Kel."
